{"data":{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.22751482","type":"dois","attributes":{"doi":"10.5281/zenodo.22751482","prefix":"10.5281","suffix":"zenodo.22751482","identifiers":[{"identifier":"oai:zenodo.org:22751482","identifierType":"oai"}],"alternateIdentifiers":[{"alternateIdentifierType":"oai","alternateIdentifier":"oai:zenodo.org:22751482"}],"creators":[{"name":"Jayadevan, Achyuth","nameType":"Personal","givenName":"Achyuth","familyName":"Jayadevan","affiliation":["Manipal Institute of Technology, MAHE"],"nameIdentifiers":[{"nameIdentifier":"0009-0008-8745-4078","nameIdentifierScheme":"ORCID"}]}],"titles":[{"title":"An irreducible nonmonomial representation of degree eight in a semiabelian group of order 2592"}],"publisher":"Zenodo","container":{},"publicationYear":2026,"subjects":[],"contributors":[],"dates":[{"date":"2026-09-14","dateType":"Issued"}],"language":"en","types":{"ris":"GEN","bibtex":"misc","citeproc":"article","schemaOrg":"CreativeWork","resourceType":"","resourceTypeGeneral":"Preprint"},"relatedIdentifiers":[{"relationType":"IsVersionOf","relatedIdentifier":"10.5281/zenodo.22751481","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"}],"relatedItems":[],"sizes":[],"formats":[],"version":"1.0.0","rightsList":[{"rights":"Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International","rightsUri":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode","schemeUri":"https://spdx.org/licenses/","rightsIdentifier":"cc-by-4.0","rightsIdentifierScheme":"SPDX"},{"rights":"Copyright © 2026 Achyuth Jayadevan.","rightsUri":"http://rightsstatements.org/vocab/InC/1.0/"}],"descriptions":[{"description":"We construct a semiabelian group \\(G\\) of order \\(2592\\) with an irreducible complex representation of degree eight which is not induced from a linear character of any subgroup. Write \\(M=C_2^3\\rtimes A_4\\) as a signed permutation group and choose \\(K\\leq M\\) with \\(K\\cong Q_8\\rtimes C_3\\) and \\([M:K]=4\\). The group \\(G\\) is the semidirect product of the augmentation module of \\(\\mathbb F_3[M/K]\\) by \\(M\\). A coordinate character and the irreducible quaternionic representation of \\(K\\) give the degree-eight representation. Any monomial realization would produce a subgroup of index two in \\(K\\), which does not exist. This disproves the assertion in Kourovka Problem 21.68 that every finite semiabelian group is monomial.","descriptionType":"Abstract"}],"geoLocations":[],"fundingReferences":[],"xml":"","url":"https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22751482","contentUrl":null,"metadataVersion":0,"schemaVersion":"http://datacite.org/schema/kernel-4","source":"api","isActive":true,"state":"findable","reason":null,"viewCount":0,"viewsOverTime":[],"downloadCount":0,"downloadsOverTime":[],"referenceCount":0,"citationCount":0,"citationsOverTime":[],"partCount":0,"partOfCount":0,"versionCount":0,"versionOfCount":1,"created":"2026-09-14T14:17:00.000Z","registered":"2026-09-14T14:17:01.000Z","published":"2026","updated":"2026-09-14T14:17:01.000Z"},"relationships":{"client":{"data":{"id":"cern.zenodo","type":"clients"}},"provider":{"data":{"id":"cern","type":"providers"}},"media":{"data":{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.22751482","type":"media"}},"references":{"data":[]},"citations":{"data":[]},"parts":{"data":[]},"partOf":{"data":[]},"versions":{"data":[]},"versionOf":{"data":[{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.22751481","type":"dois"}]}}}}